{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act15d0_level_act15d0_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act15d0",
  "stageId": "act15d0_08",
  "title": "Denouement",
  "storyCode": "MB-8",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "078b7ffb5d0f3f322dccb014bccf843ca0c7c588f6032e832ca607135ec99309",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Mighty big ruckus you've caused, Mr. Anthony.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Had I not known all about your plan in advance, I'm afraid not even I could've stopped you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "You're Jesselton?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "That's right. I'm Jesselton.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "I'm sure you've noticed we've passed by each other in the prison a couple times, but allow me to introduce myself again.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "My name is Jesselton Williams, the very last obstacle to your prison break charade.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Where's Domma?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Right here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Prisoner A",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Domma",
      "text": "Anthony, I'm sorry.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Domma",
      "text": "I was waitin' here for you. I didn't expect this guy to barge into the clinic with the prisoners...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "Domma...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "This is such a gloomy place. It would be unbecoming of me to let a beautiful lady wait here all by herself.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "That's why I figured I'd offer her my protection.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "Mr. Jesselton...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Oh, Ms. Robin, it looks like I was expecting a little too much from you. What a disappointment.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Or perhaps you never tried to kill him in the first place?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "I...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "She failed, and your lackeys couldn't hurt me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Yet you spared her life. I must say, you are a fine gentleman, Mr. Anthony.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Save it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Very well. Let us get straight to the point.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Mr. Anthony, if you don't want this young lady to die, please step over here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Ms. Kafka, I would appreciate it if you would stay right there.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "I can tell you're the opportunistic kind. Please try not to do anything that would put Ms. Domma in harm's way.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "Hmph.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Yes, just stand right there.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "All of you, surround him.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Domma",
      "text": "Anthony, don't listen to him!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "It's okay, Domma. We are going to save you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "I have to hand it to you, Mr. Anthony. It's admirable that you are able to stay calm even in such a precarious situation.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "I'm sure you know what it is that I want, and you also know that I won't spare you out of compassion.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Here's my suggestion. Abandon the lady, abandon your affectations, and come fight me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "You're wasting your breath.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "I wonder how long you can keep this up.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "And you, Ms. Robin.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "Eh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "I would like you to kill Mr. Anthony. After all, you still have a job to do.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "It doesn't matter what kind of agreement you've made with Mr. Anthony or if you've had a change of heart, for whatever reason.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "If you want the money, and if you want to save your father, then this is your last, best hope.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "I...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Why the hesitation? Did Anthony promise you a blank check? Or have you grown soft on him after all this time?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Last chance, Ms. Robin.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "I... I...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Think of your father. Think of how your life is in tatters. Think of your future, your wish.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "If I were you, I wouldn't hesitate.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "What are you trying to do?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "What am I trying to do?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Isn't it obvious? If all I wanted was to kill you, I've had plenty of chances here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "But that would be a li'l bit boring, wouldn't it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "I've never found killing someone all that much fun, Mr. Anthony.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "But I really enjoy those moments when a person is faced with no choice but to abandon their past.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "That is why I lured Ms. Robin here. I long to see her change. I crave for her fall.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "And I thirst for your change as well. I thirst for the moment you finally lose your cool and bare your fangs, all for the sake of your family, your goals!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "I mean it, Mr. Anthony. Take off your gentleman's facade.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Think of your family. Think of all you've been through, the humiliations you've faced. Think of the reason you're breaking out of this prison.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Do you really want to die here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Do you really want to throw your life away for a woman you've only known a few years?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Stand up, Mr. Anthony. Push Ms. Robin aside, forget Ms. Domma, come at me and kill me!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Not everyone out there is like you, Jesselton.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "You should know that you aren't all that special either, Anthony.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "I'll give you five seconds, Ms. Robin. If you don't act, I'll do it myself, and you'll die here with him.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Five.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Ms. Robin, you have yet to pay off your father's medical bills, and Mr. Anthony is penniless.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "Anthony, I...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Four.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Mr. Anthony, your parents are having a miserable time in prison. They're being ostracized.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Father, mother...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Three.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Domma",
      "text": "Anthony, don't worry about me! You can't die here!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Prisoner A",
      "text": "Hmph!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Domma",
      "text": "Gah...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Prisoner A",
      "text": "Guess what, bitch? You ain't killing yourself on my watch.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Domma",
      "text": "Ro...bin... don't...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Well, Ms. Domma is quite a bit more fiery than I expected. How admirable.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Alas, it didn't go as she planned.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Jes-sel-ton.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Now that's the face I want to see, Mr. Anthony. Wonderful.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "I'm curious. What is it that fuels your conviction?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Do you think your death can buy my sympathy for everyone else here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Are your principles worth that much to you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Perhaps you still have a card up your sleeve?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "I've done much to betray my principles in this prison.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "I sweet-talked the jailers, stuck up for Barton, fought those I didn't want to fight, and lived a life I didn't want to live.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "This has nothing to do with principles.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "This only has to do with me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "I won't sacrifice Domma for my own ends. That's all there is to it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Even though your family is still waiting for you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "You have no right to talk about my family.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Even though you have revenge to take and questions you need answered?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "None of that is more important than the life of a friend.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Even if it ends up killing you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Even if it ends up killing me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "Anthony...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "You have to think everything through and make your own choices. Then, you need to take responsibility for each of those choices.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Otherwise, you'll never be able to take your fate into your own hands.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "You must scrutinize yourself and think about what it is that you want to do.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "Anthony...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "How regrettable.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Well then. Two.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "One.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Ms. Robin, I understand your struggle, but you have a decision to make.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "Anthony.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "No matter what you end up doing, don't regret your decision, Robin.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "Right.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Prisoner A",
      "text": "Gurghh!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "Anthony, leave Domma to me!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Prisoner B",
      "text": "Tsk! You prick!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "Heh, you two sure kept me waiting!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Prisoner B",
      "text": "When did you...?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Prisoner B",
      "text": "...Euggh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "Anthony!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "*Roars*!!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "So this is the trick you had up your sleeve.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "You knew Ms. Robin was on your side?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Perhaps your offer wasn't enticing enough.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Are you sure about this, Ms. Robin?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "From where I'm standing, you have chosen a path that has no future.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "It's true that if it wasn't for the Simons, my father wouldn't have turned out like that, but it's his fault for not getting back up on his feet.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "I knew that. I just didn't want to accept it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "And I... really don't want to do that either.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "Anthony promised to come up with something to raise money for my father's medical bills.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "But that doesn't actually matter.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "I've decided I'm not going to kill Anthony, and even if he doesn't help me, I'll come up with something else myself.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "And if my father dies before I get the money, then I...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "Then I'll kill myself and apologize to him in hell.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "That's my decision.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Beautiful. Beautiful indeed.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "What a beautiful resolve, Ms. Robin.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "I suppose you've made your decision. You want to turn your back on our agreement because of that resolve.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Very well. Who am I to blame you for that? I should applaud you for making that decision, even.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "That said, I still have to point out one thing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "When I said this path had no future, I didn't mean you won't have much of a future after your little jailbreak.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "I mean it all ends right here and now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "There isn't a future where you make it out of this prison alive.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "I guess we'll have to see about that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "No, no, no.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "I have to admit. You are very strong, Mr. Anthony.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "As for me, killing and violence aren't exactly my thing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "That's why Ms. Domma was only the first step in my attempt to stop you from 'seeing about that'.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "As for the second step—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Ugh... agh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "Waagh!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Domma",
      "text": "Anthony, Kafka, are you two okay?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "I'm... fine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "You haven't forgotten the shackles on you, have you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "Dammit, this guy's thought everything through.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "I appreciate your compliment, Ms. Kafka.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "You asshole, you've been lying to Robin from the start!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "No, no, no. I just like to have more than one option.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Had Ms. Robin gone through with the deal and succeeded, it would've saved me quite a bit of trouble.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "And if she failed, as you can see, I've prepared a fall-back for her.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "You can't say I planned for all this without putting myself in her shoes.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "Easy for you to say, but you dragged her into this mess.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Haha, I never denied I wanted to see her struggle, did I?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "However, Ms. Kafka, you are very much in the know yourself. Think about it. Do you think she could've raised enough money for her father's surgery, had I not dragged her into this mess?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "I think it's extraordinarily unlikely.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "Hmph.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "See? You can't argue with me on that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Hmph... I have to admit. She has a lot more to gain... by helping you out.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "But she didn't help you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "And that's more than enough for me!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "*Roars*!!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Still trying to fight despite the circumstances?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Very well, then allow me to personally tear apart that last delusion.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "Anthony, I'll back you up!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "Tsk, I ain't quite as strong as Anthony, y'know...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "Huh... You guys watch out! His hand...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "His hand turned black!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "Ahh, how heartwarming.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "To think I get to crush this emotional get-together...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jesselton",
      "text": "It just fills me with delight, Anthony!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
